  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of the tangent to the hyperbola <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math> in parametric form is<br /><math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br />Solving with <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math>, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Area bounded by <math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math>&nbsp;sq.&nbsp;units",
